    "title": "Software performance",
    "description": "I have owned the SPECjbb benchmark performance work for Intel. I work with OEMs to share best methods of achieving best scores of the benchmark on new hardware.  Forecasted where the performance would be for new hardware yet to be manufactured based on current models and current performance. \nProvided feedback to chip design on how certain features in hardware impact the performance of SPECjbb.\nWork in a fast paced multi-project environment, doing everything from performance analysis to system debug.",
